    (4 : G)^4 * rowProduct (neighbors 8) (values x y) (constants 8) - GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value root_8 x y ^ 4 =
      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_8 x y + values x y 8 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_8 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 8) nodes (constants 8) F starA_8 starB_8 root_8 8 4 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

