      GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value F x y * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starA_30 x y + values x y 30 * GraphCert.Quartic.Polynomial.value starB_30 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 30) nodes (constants 30) F starA_30 starB_30 root_30 30 1 4 (by decide +kernel) x y

